<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02GJ">Remark <span data-tag="02GJ">4.6.4.16</span>.</a> Let $F: K \rightarrow \operatorname{\mathcal{C}}$ be a morphism of simplicial sets. For every simplicial set $J$, composition with the slice diagonal $\delta _{/F}$ of Construction <a data-tag="02GH" href="/tag/02GH">4.6.4.15</a> determines a map of sets </p>
<div class="equation">
  \[  \operatorname{Hom}_{\operatorname{Set_{\Delta }}}( J, \operatorname{\mathcal{C}}_{/F} ) \rightarrow \operatorname{Hom}_{\operatorname{Set_{\Delta }}}( J, \operatorname{\mathcal{C}}\vec{\times }_{ \operatorname{Fun}(K, \operatorname{\mathcal{C}}) } \{ F\}  ). \]
</div>
<p> Under the bijection of Remark <a data-tag="01KN" href="/tag/01KN">4.6.4.11</a>, this identifies with the map </p>
<div class="equation">
  \[  \operatorname{Hom}_{(\operatorname{Set_{\Delta }})_{K/} }( J \star K, \operatorname{\mathcal{C}}) \rightarrow \operatorname{Hom}_{(\operatorname{Set_{\Delta }})_{K/} }( J \diamond K, \operatorname{\mathcal{C}}) \]
</div>
<p> given by precomposition with the comparison map $c_{J,K}: J \diamond K \twoheadrightarrow J \star K$ of Notation <a data-tag="01HR" href="/tag/01HR">4.6.2.3</a>. </p>
</article>
